---
// Where to go when the docs don't answer it.
---

<section class="band not-content" data-docs="help-band">
  <div class="inner">
    <p><strong>Can't find what you need?</strong> Ask on our Discord, or email surogate@invergent.ai.</p>
    <div class="links">
      <a href="/work/whats-new/">What's new</a>
      <a href="https://discord.gg/eVTq93BrQ4">Discord</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .band {
    background: var(--d-bg);
  }
  .inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 48px 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px 40px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
  p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--d-text);
  }
  strong {
    color: var(--d-ink);
  }
  .links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px 28px;
  }
  .links a {
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--d-link);
  }
</style>
